MCP is an open protocol standardizing how AI agents take action across external tools and systems. Where RAG governs what information is retrieved, MCP governs how agents act querying live systems, running commands, and triggering workflows within defined security and governance boundaries. In a converged OT/IT architecture, MCP lets agents reach across both layers under role-based access control, bridging historian, ERP, maintenance, and work-order systems in a single governed intertion